      "seconds": 23.17,
      "answer": "IVMS (In-Vehicle Monitoring System) is part of the vehicle telematics offerings within the NAVAS ecosystem. It provides core functionalities such as location tracking, trip history, and geofencing. Additionally, it can be enhanced with add-ons like ECO for driver behavior monitoring and BI dashboards for business intelligence. The system aims to ensure stable tracking, compliance, and readiness for reporting, with features like overspeed alerts, ignition status, and geofence monitoring.\n\nSource: NAVAS CMS User Manual — this is the documented design; I can't confirm from here which parts are live.",
