      "answer": "VEBA is a system within the NAVAS platform that introduces marketplace behaviors such as asset listings, booking approvals, conflict alerts, and payments. It is designed to facilitate the monetization of assets by allowing asset owners to list their vehicles or equipment and earn revenue from idle assets. VEBA also includes features like real-time availability, booking management, and conflict resolution. Additionally, it requires KYC verification, telematics unit linkage, and includes AI-driven leakage shields to prevent fraud and ensure secure transactions.",
